/page/Magesteel\" title=\"Magesteel\">Magesteel</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Magesteel\" title=\"Magesteel\">Magesteel</a>:</b> <b>Magesteel</b> is a material commonly used in spellcasting implements and generally has a slightly higher hardness than a high quality <a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a> equivalent.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008000001</span>8,000<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;1<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">cp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Copper Piece</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">4 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a></b>, Turn in 15&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_War_Wizards\" title=\"Item:Commendation: War Wizards\">Commendations: War Wizards</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_War_Wizards\" title=\"Item:Commendation: War Wizards\">Commendation: War Wizards</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader. This is a token of favor earned by helping the War Wizards. You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spellcasting_Implement\" title=\"Spellcasting Implement\">Spellcasting Implement +18</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spellcasting_Implement\" title=\"Spellcasting Implement\">Spellcasting Implement +18</a>:</b> Passive: +18 <a href=\"/page/Implement_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Implement bonus\">Implement bonus</a> to Universal <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Manipulation_(enchantment)\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation (enchantment)\">Elemental Manipulation</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Manipulation_(enchantment)\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation (enchantment)\">Elemental Manipulation</a>:</b> This item provides a +90 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to your Acid, Cold, Electric, and Fire <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Spell Lore VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Spell Lore VI</a>:</b> Passive: All of your spells gain a 6% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alarphon%27s_Staff:_Spell_Selection\" title=\"Alarphon&#39;s Staff: Spell Selection\">Alarphon's Staff: Spell Selection</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alarphon%27s_Staff:_Spell_Selection\" title=\"Alarphon&#39;s Staff: Spell Selection\">Alarphon's Staff: Spell Selection</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 20<br /><b>Charges: </b>25 (0/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 25 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:0)</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Alarphon%27s_Staff.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Alarphon%27s_Staff.png/420px-Alarphon%27s_Staff.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"690\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Alarphon%27s_Staff.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This metal staff hums with power. Arcane runes are inscribed along its length. In the hands of an arcane caster, this staff is capable of casting a diverse array of offensive spells. Although this staff does not regain charges when you rest, it recharges automatically as time passes.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li>Class Required cannot be satisfied with UMD.</li>\n<li>Spellcasting Implement does not display on <a href=\"/page/Relton_Traplo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Relton Traplo\">Relton Traplo</a> (War Wizard Trader) item description. Only after the item is created will it have an Spellcasting Implement shown.</li>\n<li>The charges on this item recharge over time, not with rest.</li>\n<li>In-quest, the spells regen at a rate of one charge every thirty seconds exactly, whilst not in use. This generally makes it possible, except in very intensive use, to use this spell selection variation of the spell exclusively and not bother taking the spell in a normal spell slot.</li>\n<li>In each instance the damage done by this variation of the spell is 50% to 100% more powerful than the base damage of the normal spell. This can be further increased by any enhancements, feats &amp; abilities that impact on wand damage.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817164226\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.144 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4361/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36051/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12600/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n115.30%  142.215     54 Template:IO\n100.00%  123.339      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  123.339      1 -total\n 95.89%  118.274      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 39.14%   48.281      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 38.48%   47.456      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 37.27%   45.964      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 36.05%   44.468      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.98%   27.112      9 Template:Popup\n 14.53%   17.924      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24242-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817164226 and revision id 688154. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Weapon\n  | name                     = Alarphon's Staff\n  | damage                   = 3[1d6] + 6 Bludgeon, Magic\n  | crit                     = 20 / x2\n  | type                     = Quarterstaff\n  | hand                     = Two-handed\n  | class                    = Bludgeoning\n  | prof                     = Simple\n  | reqtrait                 = Class Required: Wizard, Sorcerer, Bard\n  | UMD DC                   = 0\n  | damagemod                = STR\n  | attackmod                = STR\n  | durability               = 280\n  | material                 = Magesteel\n  | hardness                 = 30\n  | minlevel                 = 20\n  | quest                    = Eveningstar\n  | chest                    = \n  | end reward               = \n  | turn in                  = {{Commendation|WW|15}}\n  | epic                     = no\n  | basevalue                = 8,000 pp 1 cp\n  | weight                   = 4 lbs\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Enhancement bonus|I|6}}\n* {{SpellPower|Elemental Manipulation}}\n* {{Spelllore|Spell|VI}}\n* {{Clicky|Alarphon's Staff: Spell Selection|20|25|0}} \n  | crafting                 = \n  | craftingupgrade          = \n  | pic                      = Alarphon's Staff shown.jpg\n  | picdesc                  = Alarphon's Staff.png\n  | description              = This metal staff hums with power. Arcane runes are inscribed along its length. In the hands of an arcane caster, this staff is capable of casting a diverse array of offensive spells. Although this staff does not regain charges when you rest, it recharges automatically as time passes.\n  | tips                     = \n* Class Required cannot be satisfied with UMD.\n* Spellcasting Implement does not display on [[Relton Traplo]] (War Wizard Trader) item description. Only after the item is created will it have an Spellcasting Implement shown.\n* The charges on this item recharge over time, not with rest.\n* In-quest, the spells regen at a rate of one charge every thirty seconds exactly, whilst not in use. This generally makes it possible, except in very intensive use, to use this spell selection variation of the spell exclusively and not bother taking the spell in a normal spell slot.\n* In each instance the damage done by this variation of the spell is 50% to 100% more powerful than the base damage of the normal spell. This can be further increased by any enhancements, feats & abilities that impact on wand damage.\n\n}}",
